title: Sovnarkom
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: sovnarkom_timer == 0 and prime_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
on-arrival: week_actions += 1; sovnarkom_timer = 2;
tags: sovnarkom, government
card-image: img/sovnarkom1.jpg

= Sovnarkom

The Council of People's Commissars (Sovnarkom). 

- @sovnarkom_menu
- @sovnarkom_administration
- @sovnarkom_composition
- @sovnarkom_null
- @cut_officialdom
- @found_welfare
- @root: Do not change policy
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@sovnarkom_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: sovnarkom_chair

@sovnarkom_return
title: Cancel action
go-to: sovnarkom_chair

  
@sovnarkom_menu
title: COMMISSARIATS
go-to: sovnarkom

@sovnarkom_administration
title: ADMINISTRATION

- @found_admin_department
- @found_littlesov
- @sovnarkom_hirestaff
- @sovnarkom_return
  
@found_admin_department
title: Found a Sovnarkom Admin Department. 
subtitle: -1 resources - We need a permanent staff seeing to administrative matters. 
view-if: admin_founded = 0
on-arrival: admin_founded = 1; resources -= 1; sovnarkom_expend += 0.25; efficacy_sovnarkom += 0.2 if efficacy_sovnarkom < 1; efficacy_finance += 0.1 if efficacy_finance < 1; efficacy_foreign += 0.1 if efficacy_foreign < 1; efficacy_military += 0.1 if efficacy_military < 1; efficacy_enlightenment += 0.1 if efficacy_enlightenment < 1; efficacy_internal += 0.1 if efficacy_internal < 1; efficacy_railways += 0.1 if efficacy_railways < 1; efficacy_trade += 0.1 if efficacy_trade < 1; efficacy_justice += 0.1 if efficacy_justice < 1; efficacy_agriculture += 0.1 if efficacy_agriculture < 1; efficacy_foodsupply += 0.1 if efficacy_foodsupply < 1; efficacy_nationalities += 0.1 if efficacy_nationalities < 1; efficacy_welfare += 0.1 if efficacy_welfare < 1; 

@found_littlesov
title: Found a "Little Sovnarkom" council
subtitle: -0.5 resources - We need an auxiliary council to oversee minor issues. 
view-if: littlesov_founded = 0
on-arrival: littlesov_founded = 1; resources -= 0.5; 

@sovnarkom_hirestaff
title: Hire administrative staff. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: admin_founded = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We lack an administrative department. 
on-arrival: resources -= 0.5; efficacy_sovnarkom += 0.1 if efficacy_sovnarkom < 1;




@cut_officialdom
title: Eliminate government "officialdom".
subtitle: Cut unnecessary privileges and reduce all salaries to worker' wages.
view-if: officialdom = 0
on-arrival: officialdom = 1; efficacy_sovnarkom += 0.1 if efficacy_sovnarkom < 1; efficacy_finance -= 0.05; efficacy_foreign -= 0.05; efficacy_military -= 0.05; efficacy_enlightenment -= 0.05; efficacy_internal -= 0.05; efficacy_railways -= 0.05; efficacy_trade -= 0.05; efficacy_justice -= 0.05; efficacy_agriculture -= 0.05; efficacy_foodsupply -= 0.05; efficacy_nationalities -= 0.05; efficacy_welfare -= 0.05; sovnarkom_expend -= 0.25; foreignaffairs_expend -= 0.5; military_expend -= 0.5; enlightmenet_expend -= 0.5; railways_expend -= 0.5; trade_expend -= 0.5; finance_expend -= 0.5; justice_expend -= 0.5; agriculture_expend -= 0.5; foodsupply_expend -= 0.5; nationalities_expend -= 0.5; welfare_expend -= 0.5; monthly_inflation -= 0.1; labor_unrest -= 5; intelligentsia_unrest -= 5; 

@found_welfare
title: Found a new People's Commissariat for Welfare. 
subtitle: We need a dedicated commissariat focusing on the people's general welfare. 
view-if: welfare_founded = 0
on-arrival: welfare_founded = 1; efficacy_welfare += 0.5 if efficacy_welfare < 1; welfare_expend += 0.5; labor_unrest -= 5; peasant_unrest -= 2; intelligentsia_unrest -= 2; 
go-to: welfare_commissar_menu

@welfare_commissar_menu

We need to select a people's commsisar to head the commissariat. 

- @select_kollontai
- @select_vinokurov
- @select_milyutin

@select_kollontai
title: Alexandra Kollontai
subtitle: {!
Left — Strong social reformer, feminist, and radical.<br>
Overall skill: ★★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★★★
!}
on-arrival: welfare_minister = "Kollontai"; welfare_minister_party = "Bolshevik"; leftcom_dissent -= 5; 
go-to: welfare

@select_vinokurov
title: Alexander Vinokurov
subtitle: {!
Early social-democratic organizer with experience in economic and legal matters.<br>
Overall skill: ★★☆<br>
Suitability: ★★☆
!}
on-arrival: welfare_minister = "Vinokurov"; welfare_minister_party = "Bolshevik"; 
go-to: welfare

@select_milyutin
title: Nikolai Milyutin
subtitle: {!
Architectual student; briefly managed Russia's largest disability insurance fund.<br>
Overall skill: ★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★
!}
on-arrival: welfare_minister = "N_Milyutin"; welfare_minister_party = "Bolshevik"; 
go-to: welfare


@sovnarkom_composition
title: APPOINT/REMOVE COMMISSARS
new-page: true

- #sovnarkom_appointments
- @cancel_composition

@cancel_composition
title: Stop changing composition. 
go-to: sovnarkom_chair


@foreign
title: Foreign Affairs — [+ foreign_minister +]
tags: sovnarkom_appointments

Who should we replace [+ foreign_minister +] with? 

- #foreign_candidates
- @keep_foreign

@foreign_trotsky
title: Leon Trotsky
subtitle: {!
Internationally-reknown and experienced organizer.<br>
Overall skill: ★★★★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★☆
!}
tags: foreign_candidates
view-if: foreign_minister != "Trotsky" 
on-arrival: foreign_minister = "Trotsky"; foreign_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
go-to: sovnarkom_composition

@foreign_chicherin
title: Georgy Chicherin
subtitle: {!
Highly qualified diplomat, polyglot, and negotiator.<br>
Overall skill: ★★★★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★★★
!}
tags: foreign_candidates 
view-if: foreign_minister != "Chicherin" 
choose-if: foreign_minister != "Chicherin" and chicherin_available = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Chicherin is currently imprisoned by the British. 
on-arrival: foreign_minister = "Chicherin"; foreign_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
go-to: sovnarkom_composition

@foreign_ioffe
title: Adolph Ioffe
subtitle: {!
Follower of Trotsky with some diplomatic experience.<br>
Overall skill: ★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★
!}
tags: foreign_candidates 
view-if: foreign_minister != "Ioffe" 
on-arrival: foreign_minister = "Ioffe"; foreign_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
go-to: sovnarkom_composition

@foreign_martov
title: Iulius Martov
subtitle: {!
Menshevik Int. — RSDLP founding member and reknown Menshevik leader. 
Overall skill: ★★★★★<br>
Suitability: ★★★★
!}
tags: foreign_candidates 
view-if: foreign_minister != "Martov"
choose-if: foreign_minister != "Martov" and left_m_relation > 60 and m_in_gov = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Menshevik Int. — RSDLP founding member and reknown Menshevik leader.<br>[?if m_in_gov != 1: We haven't assented to Menshevik participation in government. ?]<br>[?if left_m_relation <= 60: Martov would not accept this. ?]
on-arrival: foreign_minister = "Martov"; foreign_minister_party = "Menshevik"; left_m_relation += 10
go-to: sovnarkom_composition

@keep_foreign
title: Cancel action. 
subtitle: [?if foreign_minister != "Vacant": Keep [+ foreign_minister +] in place. ?]
go-to: sovnarkom_composition


